---
import '../../styles/coverage.css';
import OutlineIcon from '../shared/OutlineIcon.astro';
---

<section class="coverage-section section-pad">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading centered">
      <p class="label muted">What parents will learn</p>
      <h2 id="outcomes">What you will be able to decide after this webinar</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="coverage-grid">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="compass" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">01</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Stream choice without panic or bias</h3>
        <p>Understand how to compare Science, Commerce and Arts without defaulting to pressure, reputation, or assumptions.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="brain" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">02</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Marks versus real fit</h3>
        <p>See why strong marks alone do not guarantee that Science is the healthiest or smartest long-term fit.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="sparkles" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">03</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Early aptitude and learning signals</h3>
        <p>Learn to notice the patterns that show up early, before stream pressure turns uncertainty into rushed decisions.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="heart-handshake" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">04</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Less conflict at home</h3>
        <p>Get practical language for calmer parent-child career conversations when expectations and preferences are not aligned.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="school" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">05</span>
        </div>
        <h3>NEP flexibility explained simply</h3>
        <p>Understand how subject flexibility changes the way Mumbai parents should think about stream planning today.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="badge-check" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">06</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Know when deeper guidance is worth it</h3>
        <p>Recognize when a family needs structured assessment and counselling instead of more casual advice from others.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="coverage-after">
      <div class="coverage-emotion-card">
        <p class="label muted">Before the webinar</p>
        <h3>What parents usually feel</h3>
        <ul class="bullet-list">
          <li>Too many opinions, too little confidence</li>
          <li>Fear of pushing the child into the wrong stream</li>
          <li>Pressure rising faster than clarity</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="coverage-emotion-card">
        <p class="label muted">After the webinar</p>
        <h3>What parents should leave with</h3>
        <ul class="bullet-list">
          <li>A calmer framework for stream conversations at home</li>
          <li>Better understanding of aptitude, personality, and study style</li>
          <li>More confidence before Class 10 pressure peaks</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
